OL,3,GNEWSASuspended Labour candidate wins
OL,4,Aby-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Labour party candidate that is
OL,7,Fcurrently suspended by the party has
OL,8,Fwon a by-election.
OL,10,FVoters in Hyndburn have elected Jackie
OL,11,FRawstron as councillor for the Huncoat
OL,12,Fward following the death of
OL,13,Flong-standing Labour councillor Dave
OL,14,FParkins.
