OL,3,GNEWSASuspended Labour candidate wins
OL,4,Aby-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe campaign was not without
OL,7,Fcontroversy after Reform UK county
OL,8,Fcouncillor Joel Tetlow called the
OL,9,Fvisually impaired candidate a "Stevie
OL,10,FWonder lookalike" online prompting
OL,11,Fcondemnation, only for some of her own
OL,12,Fsocial media posts to be made public of
OL,13,Fan alleged similar nature.
OL,15,FShe was suspended by the Labour party
OL,16,Fduring the campaign for an
OL,17,Finvestigation to take place into those
OL,18,Fposts, but could not be removed as a
OL,19,Fcandidate as this happened after she
OL,20,Fhad been nominated.
